=== cygpath against the shell's own view
-u -a foo is $PWD/foo
-u -a keeps a trailing slash
-w -a foo is $PWD\foo
-m -a ../x
-w ../x resolves
-u -a leaves a POSIX name alone
round trip
/tmp maps to a drive path
-w and -m agree
-s then -l round trips
-l -a gives the long absolute name
