=== man pages
cygpath (1)          - convert Unix and Windows format paths
start (1)            - open a file, folder or URL, or start a program
winpty (1)           - run a program on a console (pass-through)
=== start
Usage: start [/wait] [/min | /max] FILE|URL|PROGRAM [ARG]...
Open FILE, a folder or URL with the program Windows associates with it,
or start PROGRAM with ARGs, without waiting for it.

  -w, --wait, /wait   wait for the program and return its exit status
  /min, /max          start the window minimized or maximized
  -h, --help          display this help and exit
      --version       output version information and exit
[1]
