Usage: winpty [OPTIONS] PROGRAM [ARG]...
Run PROGRAM with ARGs.

wbsh runs programs on a real console or pseudo console already, so winpty
only passes the command through: a builtin, function or program on PATH,
with its exit status. winpty's own options (-Xallow-non-tty, -Xplain,
-Xcolor, --mouse, --showkey) are accepted and ignored.
[1]
